      "name": "dsh-skill-shelf",
      "title": {
        "en": "Skill Shelf",
        "zh": "技能书架"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Browse, search and switch every local skill from one panel: Settings → Skill Shelf (General / Workspace / Market / Trash), or the 960 px sidebar panel. Each row shows day / week / total call counts from an append-only local ledger at ~/.dsh/skill-usage-manager/usage-ledger.jsonl that survives session deletion, and group headers sum them. Installs are content-audited first (hidden control characters, pipe-to-shell, credential paths); GitHub sources keep a commit pin, an update check and a restorable trash. Only ~/.dsh/skills and ~/.agents/skills are writable, and every toggle is a sidecar override, so skill source files never change. Pure local: no model calls; it contacts GitHub and skills.sh only for the checks and installs you start, and turning the plugin off removes the panel, the routes and the system-prompt note.",
        "zh": "在一个面板里浏览、搜索、开关本机全部技能：设置 →「技能书架」（通用 / 工作区 / 市场 / 回收站），或侧边栏 960px 面板。每行显示 `~/.dsh/skill-usage-manager/usage-ledger.jsonl` 只追加台账统计的当日 / 本周 / 累计调用次数（删掉会话也不丢），分组标题同样汇总；装前先过内容审计（隐藏控制字符、管道执行、凭据路径），GitHub 来源带 commit 钉版、更新检查与可恢复回收站。只有 `~/.dsh/skills` 与 `~/.agents/skills` 可写，所有开关都只写 sidecar 覆盖，技能源文件不动。纯本地：不调用模型；只有你主动发起的检查与安装才联网 GitHub 与 skills.sh；关掉插件后面板、路由与系统提示说明全部下线。"
      },
